				<r3d:description language="eng">BExIS is the online data repository and information system of the Biodiversity Exploratories Project (BE). The BE is a German network of biodiversity-related working groups from areas such as vegetation and soil science, zoology and forestry. Up to three years after data acquisition, the data use is restricted to members of the BE. Thereafter, the data is usually publicly available (https://www.bexis.uni-jena.de/ddm/publicsearch/index).</r3d:description>
